            "heading": "1. Return & Exchange Eligibility",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>You may request a return or exchange within 15 days of receiving your order, provided:</p><ul><li>The item is unused, unworn, and in original condition.</li><li>It includes all original packaging, certificates, guarantee cards, and tags.</li><li>It is returned with the barcode tag intact.</li><li>It is accompanied by the original invoice or proof of purchase.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qAaW9N": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. Non-Returnable Items",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We do not accept returns or exchanges for:</p><ul><li><strong>Earrings</strong> (due to hygiene)</li><li>Personalized, engraved, or made-to-order jewelry</li><li>Gold coins</li><li>Items bought during sales or promotional campaigns</li><li>Products that have been altered, resized, damaged, or show signs of wear</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gWRWRG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. How to Initiate a Return or Exchange",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Customers can initiate a return or exchange via either of the following methods:</p><ul><li><strong>Login to your account</strong> on our website, go to <strong>‘My Orders’</strong> and click <strong>‘Return’</strong></li><li>Alternatively, use the <strong>‘Track My Order’</strong> feature on the website</li></ul><p>This must be done <strong>within 15 days</strong> of receiving your item (except for non-returnable categories above).</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_abff97": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. Secure Return Process",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order includes a barcode tag for secure returns. Please follow these steps:</p><ol><li>Place the item in its original packaging.</li><li>Securely seal the package.</li><li>Our shipping agent will collect the package from your doorstep (a nominal delivery charge applies).<br/>Important: Returns not following this protocol may be rejected.</li></ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GxBKd4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5. Quality Check & Refunds",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Once we receive the returned product:</p><ul><li>It will undergo a <strong>strict quality check (QC)</strong></li><li>If the item <strong>passes QC</strong>, your <strong>refund will be processed</strong> to the original payment method within <strong>7–10 business days</strong></li><li>If the item <strong>fails QC</strong> (due to wear, alteration, damage, etc.), the return will be rejected and the item returned to you</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gePVq8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Damaged or Incorrect Deliveries",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>If your order arrives damaged or incorrect:</p><ul><li>Contact us within <strong>48 hours</strong> of delivery</li><li>Provide <strong>order number</strong> and <strong>clear photos</strong></li><li>We will arrange a <strong>replacement</strong> or <strong>full refund</strong> at no extra cost</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6jXpDT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "7. International Returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>In accordance with UAE data protection regulations, you may:</p><ul><li>International returns are accepted but <strong>shipping fees, duties, and taxes are non-refundable</strong></li><li>Customers are responsible for any <strong>customs clearance or return shipping costs</strong></li></ul>",
